    "final_answer": "## Price Difference Between Latest Apple Watch Models\n\nBased on information from apple.com, here are the starting prices for the latest models:\n\n| Product | Starting Price | Source |\n|---------|---------------|--------|\n| **Apple Watch Series 12** (latest series) | From **$399** | https://www.apple.com/apple-watch-series-12/ |\n| **Apple Watch SE 3** (latest SE) | From **$249** | https://www.apple.com/apple-watch-se-3/ |\n\n### 💰 Price Difference: **$150**\n\nThe Apple Watch Series 12 is **$150 more expensive** than the Apple Watch SE 3 at their respective starting prices ($399 vs. $249).\n\n**Notes:**\n- Apple Watch Series 12 also offers monthly payments of $33.25/mo. for 12 mo.*\n- Apple Watch SE 3 also offers monthly payments of $20.75/mo. for 12 mo.**\n- Apple offers education pricing for the SE 3, bringing it down to \"Starting at $229\" for eligible students/educators (a $20 discount).",
